# Reap What You Sow (windurst 29): the offers declined at a full inventory. A decline (any option but 3) at a full
# inventory plays nothing (the no-slot message is for option 3 only), for the 463 offer (begin) and the 479 offer (the
# repeat). Each offer is a seeded math.randomInt(1, 2) roll, so each stage repeats the talk-and-answer round: option 0,
# then option 4 (a menu answer above 3 is no acceptance either).
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=129.6,-5.75,167.5 job=WAR lvl=75
login
fill-inventory
trigger Mashuu-Ajuu                     # his default 429
finish
trigger Mashuu-Ajuu                     # the roll: 463 (option 0: nothing) or nothing
finish-if-event option=0
trigger Mashuu-Ajuu                     # his default 429
finish
